# Everything under sources/ is L0, stored byte for byte (R1): git never
# rewrites it on checkout or commit, whatever its config says. No end-of-line
# conversion (text), clean/smudge filter, $Id$ expansion (ident) or
# re-encoding (working-tree-encoding). Raw XML must keep eCFR's bytes, and
# meta.yaml fetch's: checked out with CRLF, fetch can't read one and every
# source would exit 1. tree.json, text.md and overrides.yaml are L0 too.
sources/** -text -filter -ident -working-tree-encoding
